  🍉

  💭 The cast is unnecessary or always fails once T is concrete, so the generic method is used.
  🐇❗️ 🔢🐚T ⚪🍆 x T ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ 🔲 x 🔢 ➡️ n 🍇
