      ↩️ 🍿🍆
    🍉
    🔃🐚T🍆🕊🧰 x n ➖ 1❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕 list
    🐻list x❗️
    ↩️ list
  🍉

  💭 Every call specializes with a larger type, which the specialization depth limit ends.
  🐇❗️ 🎎🐚T ⚪🍆 x T n 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ n 🙌 0 🍇
      ↩️ 0
    🍉
    ↩️ 1 ➕ 🎎🐚🍨🐚T🍆🍆🕊🧰 🍿 x 🍆 n ➖ 1❗️
  🍉

  💭 No specialization of 🔀 compiles, but the one of 🔄 created while analysing it would. As it calls 🔀, it is
  💭 not used either.
  🐇❗️ 🔀🐚T ⚪🍆 x T n 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ n 🙌 0 🍇
      ↩️ 0
    🍉
    🔄🐚T🍆🕊🧰 x n❗️ ➡️ count
    ↪️ 🔲 x 🔢 ➡️ integer 🍇
      ↩️ count ➕ integer
    🍉
    ↩️ count
  🍉

  🐇❗️ 🔄🐚T ⚪🍆 x T n 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
